<div class="WordSection2">

<h1>4. Kafka &amp; CDC Pipeline</h1>

<h2>4.1 MSK Provisioned Kafka Cluster</h2>
<table>
<tr><th style="width:35%;">Setting</th><th>Value</th></tr>
<tr><td>Cluster name</td><td>caltech-poc-msk</td></tr>
<tr><td>Kafka version</td><td>3.9.x</td></tr>
<tr><td>Broker type</td><td>kafka.m5.2xlarge (8 vCPU, 32 GiB RAM)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Broker count</td><td><strong>3 brokers across 3 AZs</strong> (us-west-2a, 2b, 2c)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Storage per broker</td><td>1000 GB EBS</td></tr>
<tr><td>Encryption at rest</td><td>KMS (alias/caltech-poc-secrets)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Encryption in transit</td><td>TLS for broker&harr;client and in-cluster</td></tr>
<tr><td>Default replication factor</td><td>3</td></tr>
<tr><td>Minimum in-sync replicas</td><td>2</td></tr>
<tr><td>Auto-create topics</td><td>Enabled</td></tr>
<tr><td>Log retention</td><td>168 hours (7 days)</td></tr>
