<h2>8.3 Resource Naming Convention</h2>
<p>All resources follow the pattern <code>caltech-poc-&lt;service&gt;-&lt;suffix&gt;</code>. Tags are applied automatically by the Terraform provider:</p>
<pre>Environment = poc
Project     = caltech
ManagedBy   = terraform
Owner       = platform-team
CostCenter  = engineering
Terraform   = true</pre>

